Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:06.20,TL,,0,0,0,,上海的秋天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:09.25,TL,,0,0,0,,又到了把目光投向旗忠的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.51,TL,,0,0,0,,白玉兰形的屋顶之下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:14.17,TL,,0,0,0,,新的大师赛正赛即将开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.81,TL,,0,0,0,,可这座球场的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.93,TL,,0,0,0,,早在“大师赛”这个名字之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.95,TL,,0,0,0,,就已经写下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}01{\fs68} 世界来到上海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:24.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1996{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:27.65,TL,,0,0,0,,上海有了自己的{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}巡回赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.07,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:32.40,TL,,0,0,0,,张德培在这里击败伊万尼塞维奇夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:34.63,TL,,0,0,0,,那时的上海 还在一步步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:37.48,TL,,0,0,0,,让更多人走近职业网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2002{\fs68}年 世界来到浦东
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.18,TL,,0,0,0,,\N年终大师杯首次落户上海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:46.72,TL,,0,0,0,,新国际博览中心成了顶尖球员的赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.14,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛里 休伊特先赢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:52.05,TL,,0,0,0,,费雷罗又把比赛追回起点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.89,TL,,0,0,0,,打到第五盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.54,TL,,0,0,0,,休伊特以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}守住冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.27,TL,,0,0,0,,上海的第一届大师杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:01:00.92,TL,,0,0,0,,就留下了一场{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2005{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:05.33,TL,,0,0,0,,旗忠打开了白玉兰形的屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:07.44,TL,,0,0,0,,大师杯回到上海
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:10.00,TL,,0,0,0,,随后连续{\fs78}4{\fs68}年在这里举行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.48,TL,,0,0,0,,一场顶尖赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:15.12,TL,,0,0,0,,也有了一座可以长久留下故事的舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.00,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:20.11,TL,,0,0,0,,纳尔班迪安原本只是替补入围
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:23.10,TL,,0,0,0,,面对费德勒 他先输掉两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:24.98,TL,,0,0,0,,却连扳两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:28.08,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘 他一度{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.81,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒又追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.29,TL,,0,0,0,,甚至带着{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}30{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:34.64,TL,,0,0,0,,站上自己的发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:36.52,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:40.02,TL,,0,0,0,,纳尔班迪安却再次把结局拉了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:42.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}小时{\fs78}33{\fs68}分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.45,TL,,0,0,0,,他赢下决胜盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:46.67,TL,,0,0,0,,一个临时得到的参赛机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.86,TL,,0,0,0,,成了上海至今难忘的一场决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}02{\fs68} 大师的主场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:55.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年 上海有了新的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:58.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}大师{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛 全球九站之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.06,TL,,0,0,0,,也是亚洲唯一的一站
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.21,TL,,0,0,0,,达维登科在决赛击败纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:06.04,TL,,0,0,0,,成为首届冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.16,TL,,0,0,0,,从这一年起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:10.87,TL,,0,0,0,,顶尖网球有了一个固定的上海之约
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:14.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68}年的决赛 穆雷先拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:15.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘又以{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:18.21,TL,,0,0,0,,准备发球结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:25.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nicely done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N处理得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:28.51,TL,,0,0,0,,德约科维奇救下一个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:30.37,TL,,0,0,0,,把比赛拖进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:32.21,TL,,0,0,0,,可危险没有过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.93,TL,,0,0,0,,在那场打了约{\fs78}20{\fs68}分钟的抢七里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.35,TL,,0,0,0,,他又救下{\fs78}4{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:40.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}次 离结束都只差一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}次 比赛都没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:51.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fantastic effort by Novak Djokovic!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇的表现太出色了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:56.49,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘抢七 德约以{\fs78}13{\fs68}比{\fs78}11{\fs68}拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:58.77,TL,,0,0,0,,到了决胜盘 他两次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:01.42,TL,,0,0,0,,终于把这场决赛赢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Victory for Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:14.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His first title here in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他的上海大师赛首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:17.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But of course, back-to-back victories{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当然 他连续两站夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}here in China.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N地点都在中国
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:22.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After proving unbeatable in Beijing last week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上周在北京 他也无人能挡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:26.24,TL,,0,0,0,,上海留下的 不只是一个冠军名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:28.45,TL,,0,0,0,,还有那些明明快到终点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.92,TL,,0,0,0,,却仍然继续的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.56,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后 费德勒的上海大师赛首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.87,TL,,0,0,0,,也从一次险境开始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.49,TL,,0,0,0,,本届首战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.80,TL,,0,0,0,,他在第三盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.36,TL,,0,0,0,,救下两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:46.13,TL,,0,0,0,,进了抢七 又救下{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is the moment of truth, surely.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一刻 胜负该见分晓了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Three match points already.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N此前已有三个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:53.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So all of those have been on Federer's serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N都出现在费德勒发球时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:58.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Here's his first on his own deal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅耶尔首次在发球时握有赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:08.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time, Federer makes no mistake{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 费德勒没有失手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with the backhand pass.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N反手穿越成功
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}次躲过出局 他才继续向前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.85,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛击败德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:22.30,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛再用两盘抢七战胜西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.19,TL,,0,0,0,,从差一点离开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:26.86,TL,,0,0,0,,到第一次捧起上海大师赛的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.52,TL,,0,0,0,,这一周 结局被改写了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:31.22,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:34.72,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒与纳达尔在上海决赛相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:36.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:39.97,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒第二次在上海大师赛夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.90,TL,,0,0,0,,两个熟悉的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:45.43,TL,,0,0,0,,把多年的对抗又带到同一张球网两边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.30,TL,,0,0,0,,而上海
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.31,TL,,0,0,0,,记住了他们共同留下的这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:52.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}03{\fs68} 白玉兰再绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:54.24,TL,,0,0,0,,但这个上海之约
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:56.62,TL,,0,0,0,,也曾被按下暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:05:00.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年 {\fs78}2021{\fs68}年 {\fs78}2022{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:03.14,TL,,0,0,0,,赛事连续{\fs78}3{\fs68}个秋天取消
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.19,TL,,0,0,0,,直到{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.82,TL,,0,0,0,,上海大师赛才重新回到赛历
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:10.55,TL,,0,0,0,,也重新等到球员和观众
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:14.43,TL,,0,0,0,,回归后的单打签表 扩展到{\fs78}96{\fs68}人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.27,TL,,0,0,0,,正赛 也延长到{\fs78}12{\fs68}天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:19.32,TL,,0,0,0,,更多球员来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.57,TL,,0,0,0,,更多比赛留在这个秋天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.78,TL,,0,0,0,,上海的舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.57,TL,,0,0,0,,又向新的故事打开了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:28.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 辛纳的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:31.49,TL,,0,0,0,,是上海四冠王德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:34.64,TL,,0,0,0,,他以{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}赢下决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.68,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次捧起这里的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:40.11,TL,,0,0,0,,德约此前在上海大师赛决赛四战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.31,TL,,0,0,0,,纪录在这一晚改变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:46.80,TL,,0,0,0,,同一座球场 开始写下新的冠军名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:50.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number one{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}delivers an impressive display to{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奉献了一场精彩表现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:58.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}claim a third Masters 1000 title of the year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下本赛季第三座大师{\fs78}1000{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:02.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 更意外的名字走到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:06.11,TL,,0,0,0,,赛前世界排名第{\fs78}204{\fs68}的瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:08.34,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛一路来到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:12.11,TL,,0,0,0,,球网对面 竟是他的表兄林德克内希
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:15.42,TL,,0,0,0,,先输一盘 再连赢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.70,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦舍罗成为大师{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛史上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.00,TL,,0,0,0,,排名最低的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:23.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Shouldn't be surprised, should we?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这不该让我们惊讶 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match, Vacherot. Two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗获胜 盘分{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:37.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot puts the icing on the cake{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗锦上添花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:41.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to a fairy tale week in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让上海这童话般的一周圆满收官
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.65,TL,,0,0,0,,两个亲人争过同一座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:47.12,TL,,0,0,0,,又在赛后相拥 上海
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:49.75,TL,,0,0,0,,也留下了属于他们的这一页
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.81,TL,,0,0,0,,从浦东的大师杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.59,TL,,0,0,0,,到旗忠的上海大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.85,TL,,0,0,0,,这座城市留下的 不只有奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.12,TL,,0,0,0,,还有逆转 重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:02.41,TL,,0,0,0,,以及一个新名字被记住的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:05.37,TL,,0,0,0,,新的秋天 新的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:07.00,TL,,0,0,0,,下一段上海传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.03,TL,,0,0,0,,会从哪一分开始？
